+## Conditional tail calls in ARM and Thumb state, with and without an IT
+## block, become a local conditional branch to a tail-call block; the
+## condition reaches the right callee in either block order.
+
+RUN: rm -rf %t.dir
+RUN: %python %p/Inputs/check-arm-conditional-tail-call.py %t.dir
